        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi mwanta Dariyusa wasonekeli mukanda wakutemesha kudi antu akwacheŋi nakwacheŋi ejima, nikunyuza yawantu yejima, nikudi akwamadimi eŋi na eŋi ejima ashakama mwahita iseki dejima, nindi, Kuwunda kuyivulili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami hinukushamu lushimbi lwakwila nami, mwahita ituŋa dawanta wami dejima, antu akamuzaali Nzambi yaDanyeli woma; muloŋa diyi Nzambi wamumi, wakola chahaya nyaka, wanta windi hiwamba kakisikaku, kuyula kwindi kwamba kashika nikunsa yanyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
